{"id":"662065","name":"大烩菜","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662065/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"油豆腐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"宽粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"肉沫","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"宽粉提前泡发备用。","img":"images/662065/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"木耳提前泡发。","img":"images/662065/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"白菜洗净切块备用。","img":"images/662065/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"前腿肉绞碎成肉沫。","img":"images/662065/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"肉沫加入适量玉米淀粉，老抽，蚝油，花生油。","img":"images/662065/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"抓拌均匀摔打，将肉泥搓成一个个丸子。","img":"images/662065/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中热油放入丸子。","img":"images/662065/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大火炸至定型再翻面，炸至金黄后捞出。","img":"images/662065/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中热油放入白菜。","img":"images/662065/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将白菜炒软。","img":"images/662065/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，盐。","img":"images/662065/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入木耳，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/662065/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/662065/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入油豆腐。","img":"images/662065/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入炸好的丸子。","img":"images/662065/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"大火煮开焖十分钟左右。","img":"images/662065/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放入宽粉。","img":"images/662065/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"焖至断生后即可出锅。","img":"images/662065/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662065/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662065/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662065/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}